{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00839","headline":"郊庙歌辞 晋朝飨乐章 羣臣酒行歌 三 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 晋朝飨乐章 羣臣酒行歌 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"令节陈高会，羣臣侍御筵。\n玉墀留爱景，金殿霭祥烟。\n振鹭涵天泽，灵禽下乐悬。\n圣明无一事，何处让尧年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00839.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00839","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}